1
00:00:01,079 --> 00:00:03,123
Why are you just standing there?

2
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:04,988
Come on, let's sit and
continue the lesson.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,248
Frame— get over here.
We're studying.

4
00:00:13,774 --> 00:00:17,267
I even wrote the formulas out for you.
This way it's easier.

5
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,960
Frame…

6
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:33,000
I don't think I can keep tutoring right now.
Can we… take a break first?

7
00:00:33,768 --> 00:00:35,290
A break?

8
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,188
Hey— don't start acting weird.

9
00:00:43,365 --> 00:00:45,006
Book, just hold me for a sec.

10
00:00:45,751 --> 00:00:47,362
Dude— what's up with you?

11
00:00:47,362 --> 00:00:54,000
Sorry I didn't say it earlier…
but that medicine I took makes me restless.

12
00:00:54,221 --> 00:00:59,082
Restless? That kind of medicine?

13
00:01:00,124 --> 00:01:07,059
Yeah… and this one's strong. If I don't calm down soon,
it's going to feel really uncomfortable.

14
00:01:08,312 --> 00:01:10,087
Can you help me calm down… please?

15
00:01:10,087 --> 00:01:12,383
Book… just help me settle it, okay?

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,749
Why didn't you tell me
you were taking something like that?

17
00:01:19,666 --> 00:01:21,000
And who did you even take it for?

18
00:01:22,089 --> 00:01:24,000
No one— I haven't used it in ages.

19
00:01:24,373 --> 00:01:28,865
Ever since we started dating, okay?
Don't get mad— just… help me first.

20
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:37,622
Book— please, hurry.
I really can't handle this.

21
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,689
Book— I'm sorry, okay?

22
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,455
I'm angry.
And I'm not easy to deal with.

23
00:01:50,876 --> 00:01:55,579
Come on, I told you…
that medicine hits hard.

24
00:01:56,057 --> 00:01:58,328
If I try to deal with it alone,
I'll feel awful.

25
00:02:00,722 --> 00:02:02,521
That's your problem.

26
00:02:02,613 --> 00:02:04,646
Book— I'm not joking here.

27
00:02:05,613 --> 00:02:07,253
Nope. I'm going to bed.

28
00:02:07,602 --> 00:02:10,209
Book, please—

29
00:02:10,209 --> 00:02:10,931
Sleep.

30
00:02:11,906 --> 00:02:13,628
You're really going to sleep?

31
00:02:15,356 --> 00:02:21,320
Fine— watch me. I'll pass every subject this term.
Just… please, help first.

32
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:24,248
Frame— let go of me. Frame!

33
00:02:24,248 --> 00:02:25,642
Book… please?
